{"agent_id":"pp3g-cfir-implement-phase-1-of-the-135-unified-agent-lifecycle","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T04:59:10.470625217Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"246c7e5b-4bb4-404f-bfd3-d9eee60e0e3f","comment_uuid":"312df931-9cd3-4bdf-841a-a7682f558b90","author":"pp3g-cfir-implement-phase-1-of-the-135-unified-agent-lifecycle","content":"Plan: Phase 1 of the #135 unified agent lifecycle watcher (monitor + notify + request-timeout; NON-DESTRUCTIVE). Approach:\n(1) OpenCode timeout config — add provider.options.{timeout,headerTimeout,chunkTimeout} to ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json for providers opencode (Zen) and opencode-go (paid). VERIFIED against live opencode 1.18.11 schema (opencode.ai/config.json): the keys nest under provider.<id>.options.* (ProviderConfig.options), NOT directly under provider.<id> — the REVISED DESIGN's 'provider.<id>.timeout' shorthand is imprecise. Conservative values with rationale to follow in commit message; chunkTimeout chosen to exceed worst-case legitimate inter-chunk gap for deepseek-v4-* reasoning models. User-level config because claude wrapper execs 'opencode run' and user config reaches all kickoff agents. Project .opencode/opencode.json untouched (no provider section).\n(2) Watcher tools/kickoff-notify.py — stdlib-only, scans .worktrees/*/ for .kickoff-status (LAUNCHING/RUNNING/DONE/FAILED/CI_FAILED) + .kickoff-metadata.json (started_at, timeout_secs) + .crosslink/.cache/last-heartbeat (PRIMARY liveness, mtime-based; verified heartbeat.py writes it). State machine per agent: LAUNCHING→RUNNING→terminal, +STALLED via heartbeat staleness with 2-consecutive-detection debounce + LAUNCHING grace period. Persisted JSON state file (idempotent on restart). Notify on transitions: COMPLETED→notify-send+optional webhook (KICKOFF_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK); STALLED→notify-send alert (NO kill/relaunch in Phase 1); FAILED/CI_FAILED→notify-send. notify-send absent on this host (libnotify-bin #133 verdict) → graceful degrade to webhook+log. --once/--dry-run flags for testing.\n(3) systemd user unit + timer files under tools/ (oneshot ExecStart=python3 <repo>/tools/kickoff-notify.py; OnBootSec=15s OnUnitActiveSec=15s Persistent=true). Files provided only — NOT enabled.\n(4) Docs — new playbook section 'Agent Lifecycle Watcher — Phase 1' (monitor/notify active, Phase 2/3 pending; two-repo sync note per §5.5, mirror to tripn-astro in same process).\nNo Phase 2 (watchdog fix/detection hardening) or Phase 3 (kill/relaunch) logic.","created_at":"2026-08-03T04:59:10.462475721Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:Ohieve4T/Ds2ELYPEzAcOMDwaFq3f+YhlG2X7VZERp4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxGQqQy0oVLZouh6RxEn/ufpBoz/MDuJORkTw/vVATpwAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABALQWNOcyXFaIRfDjlgBRn5L4N3V+mb4V2YrCXX19HFkMd6ICARKwH969jx6v0sVpJL0WAbgsEMMI4NfdDEIK9AQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:Ohieve4T/Ds2ELYPEzAcOMDwaFq3f+YhlG2X7VZERp4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxGQqQy0oVLZouh6RxEn/ufpBoz/MDuJORkTw/vVATpwAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCpnC99bOsCKGx1z+CcsX2xczon8LKqieZoddmH6YOSd5wjUkvIEHnc/b40NtCcm/zCAqKactVmJzQQeA6W0YQk="}
